msgstr "afvoer van interactive.diffFilter stem nie ooreen nie"

msgid ""
"Your filter must maintain a one-to-one correspondence\n"
"between its input and output lines."
msgstr ""
"Jou filter moet 'n een-tot-een-ooreenkoms tussen sy\n"
"invoer- en afvoerreëls handhaaf."

