msgid "Manual hunk edit mode -- see bottom for a quick guide.\n"
msgstr "Handmatige brokredigeermodus -- sien onderaan vir 'n vinnige gids.\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"---\n"
"To remove '%c' lines, make them ' ' lines (context).\n"
"To remove '%c' lines, delete them.\n"
"Lines starting with %s will be removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"Om '%c'-reëls te verwyder, maak hulle ' '-reëls (konteks).\n"
"Om '%c'-reëls te verwyder, skrap hulle.\n"
"Reëls wat met %s begin, sal verwyder word.\n"

msgid ""
"If it does not apply cleanly, you will be given an opportunity to\n"
"edit again.  If all lines of the hunk are removed, then the edit is\n"
"aborted and the hunk is left unchanged.\n"
msgstr ""
"As dit nie skoon toegepas word nie, sal jy 'n geleentheid kry om\n"
"weer te redigeer.  As alle reëls van die brok verwyder word, word die\n"
"redigering gestaak en bly die brok onveranderd.\n"

msgid "could not parse hunk header"
msgstr "kon nie brokkopstuk ontleed nie"

msgid "'git apply --cached' failed"
msgstr "'git apply --cached' het misluk"

#. TRANSLATORS: do not translate [y/n]
#. The program will only accept that input at this point.
#. Consider translating (saying "no" discards!) as
#. (saying "n" for "no" discards!) if the translation
#. of the word "no" does not start with n.
#.
msgid ""
"Your edited hunk does not apply. Edit again (saying \"no\" discards!) [y/n]? "
msgstr ""
"Jou geredigeerde brok is nie van toepassing nie. Redigeer weer (\"n\" vir "
"\"nee\" verwerp!) [y/n]? "

msgid "The selected hunks do not apply to the index!"
msgstr "Die gekose brokke is nie op die indeks van toepassing nie!"

msgid "Apply them to the worktree anyway? "
msgstr "Pas hulle in elk geval op die werkboom toe? "

msgid "Nothing was applied.\n"
msgstr "Niks is toegepas nie.\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"j - go to the next undecided hunk, roll over at the bottom\n"
"J - go to the next hunk, roll over at the bottom\n"
"k - go to the previous undecided hunk, roll over at the top\n"
"K - go to the previous hunk, roll over at the top\n"
"g - select a hunk to go to\n"
"/ - search for a hunk matching the given regex\n"
"s - split the current hunk into smaller hunks\n"
"e - manually edit the current hunk\n"
"p - print the current hunk\n"
"P - print the current hunk using the pager\n"
"> - go to the next file, roll over at the bottom\n"
"< - go to the previous file, roll over at the top\n"
"? - print help\n"
"HUNKS SUMMARY - Hunks: %d, USE: %d, SKIP: %d\n"
msgstr ""
"j - gaan na die volgende onbesliste brok, begin weer bo aan die einde\n"
"J - gaan na die volgende brok, begin weer bo aan die einde\n"
"k - gaan na die vorige onbesliste brok, begin weer onder aan die begin\n"
"K - gaan na die vorige brok, begin weer onder aan die begin\n"
"g - kies 'n brok om na toe te gaan\n"
"/ - soek vir 'n brok wat by die gegewe regex pas\n"
"s - verdeel die huidige brok in kleiner brokke\n"
"e - redigeer die huidige brok handmatig\n"
"p - druk die huidige brok\n"
"P - druk die huidige brok met die bladsyblaaier\n"
"> - gaan na die volgende lêer, begin weer bo aan die einde\n"
"< - gaan na die vorige lêer, begin weer onder aan die begin\n"
"? - druk hulp\n"
"BROKOPSOMMING - Brokke: %d, GEBRUIK: %d, OORSLAAN: %d\n"

msgid "'git apply' failed"
msgstr "'git apply' het misluk"

