"\tgit merge --no-ff\n"
"\n"
"or:\n"
"\n"
"\tgit rebase\n"
msgstr ""
"Uiteenlopende takke kan nie vooruitgespoel word nie, jy moet óf:\n"
"\n"
"\tgit merge --no-ff\n"
"\n"
"óf:\n"
"\n"
"\tgit rebase\n"

msgid "Not possible to fast-forward, aborting."
msgstr "Vooruitspoel is nie moontlik nie, staak."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"The following paths and/or pathspecs matched paths that exist\n"
"outside of your sparse-checkout definition, so will not be\n"
"updated in the index:\n"
msgstr ""
"Die volgende paaie en/of padspesifikasies pas by paaie wat buite\n"
"jou yl-uitcheck-definisie bestaan, en sal dus nie in die indeks\n"
"bygewerk word nie:\n"

msgid ""
"If you intend to update such entries, try one of the following:\n"
"* Use the --sparse option.\n"
"* Disable or modify the sparsity rules."
msgstr ""
"As jy van plan is om sulke inskrywings by te werk, probeer een van die "
"volgende:\n"
"* Gebruik die opsie --sparse.\n"
"* Deaktiveer of wysig die yl-reëls."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"Note: switching to '%s'.\n"
"\n"
"You are in 'detached HEAD' state. You can look around, make experimental\n"
"changes and commit them, and you can discard any commits you make in this\n"
"state without impacting any branches by switching back to a branch.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to create a new branch to retain commits you create, you may\n"
"do so (now or later) by using -c with the switch command. Example:\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -c <new-branch-name>\n"
"\n"
"Or undo this operation with:\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -\n"
"\n"
"Turn off this advice by setting config variable advice.detachedHead to "
"false\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Let wel: skakel oor na '%s'.\n"
"\n"
"Jy is in 'ontkoppelde HEAD'-toestand. Jy kan rondkyk, eksperimentele\n"
"veranderinge maak en hulle vaslê, en jy kan enige vasleggings wat jy in\n"
"hierdie toestand maak verwerp sonder om enige takke te beïnvloed, deur\n"
"terug te skakel na 'n tak.\n"
"\n"
"As jy 'n nuwe tak wil skep om vasleggings wat jy maak te behou, kan jy\n"
"dit (nou of later) doen deur -c met die switch-opdrag te gebruik. "
"Voorbeeld:\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -c <nuwe-taknaam>\n"
"\n"
"Of ontdoen hierdie bewerking met:\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -\n"
"\n"
"Skakel hierdie advies af deur die konfigurasieveranderlike "
"advice.detachedHead op false te stel\n"
"\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"The following paths have been moved outside the\n"
"sparse-checkout definition but are not sparse due to local\n"
"modifications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die volgende paaie is buite die yl-uitcheck-definisie\n"
"geskuif, maar is nie yl nie weens plaaslike\n"
"wysigings.\n"

msgid ""
"To correct the sparsity of these paths, do the following:\n"
"* Use \"git add --sparse <paths>\" to update the index\n"
"* Use \"git sparse-checkout reapply\" to apply the sparsity rules"
msgstr ""
"Om die ylheid van hierdie paaie reg te stel, doen die volgende:\n"
"* Gebruik \"git add --sparse <paaie>\" om die indeks by te werk\n"
"* Gebruik \"git sparse-checkout reapply\" om die yl-reëls toe te pas"

