"vaslegging %s."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"Cannot fast-forward your working tree.\n"
"After making sure that you saved anything precious from\n"
"$ git diff %s\n"
"output, run\n"
"$ git reset --hard\n"
"to recover."
msgstr ""
"Kan nie jou werkboom vooruitspoel nie.\n"
"Nadat jy seker gemaak het dat jy enigiets kosbaars uit die\n"
"$ git diff %s\n"
"uitvoer gestoor het, voer\n"
"$ git reset --hard\n"
"uit om te herstel."

msgid "Cannot merge multiple branches into empty head."
msgstr "Kan nie veelvuldige takke in 'n leë kop saamsmelt nie."

msgid "Cannot rebase onto multiple branches."
msgstr "Kan nie op veelvuldige takke herbaseer nie."

msgid "Cannot fast-forward to multiple branches."
msgstr "Kan nie na veelvuldige takke vooruitspoel nie."

msgid "Need to specify how to reconcile divergent branches."
msgstr "Moet spesifiseer hoe om uiteenlopende takke te versoen."

msgid "cannot rebase with locally recorded submodule modifications"
msgstr "kan nie herbaseer met plaaslik aangetekende submodule-wysigings nie"

msgid "git push [<options>] [<repository> [<refspec>...]]"
msgstr "git push [<opsies>] [<bewaarplek> [<verwysingspesifikasie>...]]"

msgid "tag shorthand without <tag>"
msgstr "etiket-verkorting sonder <etiket>"

msgid "--delete only accepts plain target ref names"
msgstr "--delete aanvaar slegs gewone teikenverwysingsname"

msgid ""
"\n"
"To choose either option permanently, see push.default in 'git help config'.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Om enige opsie permanent te kies, sien push.default in 'git help config'.\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"To avoid automatically configuring an upstream branch when its name\n"
"won't match the local branch, see option 'simple' of branch.autoSetupMerge\n"
"in 'git help config'.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Om te voorkom dat 'n stroomop-tak outomaties opgestel word wanneer sy naam\n"
"nie by die plaaslike tak pas nie, sien opsie 'simple' van "
"branch.autoSetupMerge\n"
"in 'git help config'.\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"The upstream branch of your current branch does not match\n"
"the name of your current branch.  To push to the upstream branch\n"
"on the remote, use\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD:%s\n"
"\n"
"To push to the branch of the same name on the remote, use\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD\n"
"%s%s"
msgstr ""
"Die stroomop-tak van jou huidige tak pas nie\n"
"by die naam van jou huidige tak nie.  Om na die stroomop-tak\n"
"op die afgeleë te stoot, gebruik\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD:%s\n"
"\n"
"Om na die tak met dieselfde naam op die afgeleë te stoot, gebruik\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD\n"
"%s%s"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"You are not currently on a branch.\n"
"To push the history leading to the current (detached HEAD)\n"
"state now, use\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD:<name-of-remote-branch>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jy is tans nie op 'n tak nie.\n"
"Om die geskiedenis wat tot die huidige (ontkoppelde HEAD)\n"
"toestand lei nou te stoot, gebruik\n"
"\n"
"    git push %s HEAD:<naam-van-afgeleë-tak>\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"To have this happen automatically for branches without a tracking\n"
"upstream, see 'push.autoSetupRemote' in 'git help config'.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Om dit outomaties te laat gebeur vir takke sonder 'n volg-\n"
"stroomop, sien 'push.autoSetupRemote' in 'git help config'.\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"The current branch %s has no upstream branch.\n"
"To push the current branch and set the remote as upstream, use\n"
"\n"
"    git push --set-upstream %s %s\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Die huidige tak %s het geen stroomop-tak nie.\n"
"Om die huidige tak te stoot en die afgeleë as stroomop te stel, gebruik\n"
"\n"
"    git push --set-upstream %s %s\n"
"%s"

#, c-format
msgid "The current branch %s has multiple upstream branches, refusing to push."
msgstr "Die huidige tak %s het verskeie stroomop-takke, weier om te stoot."

msgid ""
"You didn't specify any refspecs to push, and push.default is \"nothing\"."
msgstr ""
"Jy het geen verwysingspesifikasies om te stoot gespesifiseer nie, en "
"push.default is \"nothing\"."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"You are pushing to remote '%s', which is not the upstream of\n"
"your current branch '%s', without telling me what to push\n"
"to update which remote branch."
msgstr ""
"Jy stoot na afgeleë '%s', wat nie die stroomop van\n"
"jou huidige tak '%s' is nie, sonder om te sê wat om te stoot\n"
"om watter afgeleë tak op te dateer."

msgid ""
"Updates were rejected because the tip of your current branch is behind\n"
"its remote counterpart. If you want to integrate the remote changes,\n"
"use 'git pull' before pushing again.\n"
"See the 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' for details."
msgstr ""
"Opdaterings is geweier omdat die punt van jou huidige tak agter\n"
"sy afgeleë eweknie is. As jy die afgeleë wysigings wil integreer,\n"
"gebruik 'git pull' voordat jy weer stoot.\n"
"Sien die 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' vir besonderhede."

msgid ""
"Updates were rejected because a pushed branch tip is behind its remote\n"
"counterpart. If you want to integrate the remote changes, use 'git pull'\n"
"before pushing again.\n"
"See the 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' for details."
msgstr ""
"Opdaterings is geweier omdat 'n gestote takpunt agter sy afgeleë\n"
"eweknie is. As jy die afgeleë wysigings wil integreer, gebruik 'git pull'\n"
"voordat jy weer stoot.\n"
"Sien die 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' vir besonderhede."

msgid ""
"Updates were rejected because the remote contains work that you do not\n"
"have locally. This is usually caused by another repository pushing to\n"
"the same ref. If you want to integrate the remote changes, use\n"
"'git pull' before pushing again.\n"
"See the 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' for details."
msgstr ""
"Opdaterings is geweier omdat die afgeleë werk bevat wat jy nie\n"
"plaaslik het nie. Dit word gewoonlik veroorsaak deur 'n ander bewaarplek wat "
"na\n"
"dieselfde verwysing stoot. As jy die afgeleë wysigings wil integreer, "
"gebruik\n"
"'git pull' voordat jy weer stoot.\n"
"Sien die 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' vir besonderhede."

msgid "Updates were rejected because the tag already exists in the remote."
msgstr "Opdaterings is geweier omdat die etiket reeds in die afgeleë bestaan."

msgid ""
"You cannot update a remote ref that points at a non-commit object,\n"
"or update a remote ref to make it point at a non-commit object,\n"
"without using the '--force' option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan nie 'n afgeleë verwysing opdateer wat na 'n nie-vaslegging-objek wys "
"nie,\n"
"of 'n afgeleë verwysing opdateer om dit na 'n nie-vaslegging-objek te laat "
"wys nie,\n"
"sonder om die '--force'-opsie te gebruik.\n"

msgid ""
"Updates were rejected because the tip of the remote-tracking branch has\n"
"been updated since the last checkout. If you want to integrate the\n"
"remote changes, use 'git pull' before pushing again.\n"
"See the 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' for details."
msgstr ""
"Opdaterings is geweier omdat die punt van die afgeleë volgtak\n"
"sedert die laaste uitcheck opgedateer is. As jy die\n"
"afgeleë wysigings wil integreer, gebruik 'git pull' voordat jy weer stoot.\n"
"Sien die 'Note about fast-forwards' in 'git push --help' vir besonderhede."

#, c-format
msgid "Pushing to %s\n"
msgstr "Stoot tans na %s\n"

#, c-format
msgid "failed to push some refs to '%s'"
msgstr "kon nie sommige verwysings na '%s' stoot nie"

msgid ""
"recursing into submodule with push.recurseSubmodules=only; using on-demand "
"instead"
msgstr ""
"herhaal tans in submodule met push.recurseSubmodules=only; gebruik in plaas "
"on-demand"

#, c-format
