msgstr "kon nie '%s' verwyder nie"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"git encountered an error while preparing the patches to replay\n"
"these revisions:\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"As a result, git cannot rebase them."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"git het 'n fout teëgekom terwyl die lappe voorberei is om hierdie\n"
"hersienings oor te speel:\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"Gevolglik kan git hulle nie herbaseer nie."

#, c-format
msgid "Unknown rebase-merges mode: %s"
msgstr "Onbekende rebase-merges-modus: %s"

#, c-format
msgid "could not switch to %s"
msgstr "kon nie na %s oorskakel nie"

msgid "apply options and merge options cannot be used together"
msgstr "apply-opsies en merge-opsies kan nie saam gebruik word nie"

msgid "--empty=ask is deprecated; use '--empty=stop' instead."
msgstr "--empty=ask is verouderd; gebruik eerder '--empty=stop'."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"unrecognized empty type '%s'; valid values are \"drop\", \"keep\", and "
"\"stop\"."
msgstr ""
"onherkende leë tipe '%s'; geldige waardes is \"drop\", \"keep\" en \"stop\"."

msgid ""
"--rebase-merges with an empty string argument is deprecated and will stop "
"working in a future version of Git. Use --rebase-merges without an argument "
"instead, which does the same thing."
msgstr ""
"--rebase-merges met 'n leë string as argument is verouderd en sal in 'n "
"toekomstige weergawe van Git ophou werk. Gebruik eerder --rebase-merges "
"sonder 'n argument, wat dieselfde doen."

#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s\n"
"Please specify which branch you want to rebase against.\n"
"See git-rebase(1) for details.\n"
"\n"
"    git rebase '<branch>'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"Spesifiseer asseblief teen watter tak jy wil herbaseer.\n"
"Sien git-rebase(1) vir besonderhede.\n"
"\n"
"    git rebase '<tak>'\n"
"\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"If you wish to set tracking information for this branch you can do so with:\n"
"\n"
"    git branch --set-upstream-to=%s/<branch> %s\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"As jy naspoorinligting vir hierdie tak wil stel, kan jy dit doen met:\n"
"\n"
"    git branch --set-upstream-to=%s/<tak> %s\n"
"\n"

msgid "exec commands cannot contain newlines"
msgstr "exec-opdragte kan nie nuwe reëls bevat nie"

msgid "empty exec command"
msgstr "leë exec-opdrag"

msgid "rebase onto given branch instead of upstream"
msgstr "herbaseer op die gegewe tak in plaas van stroomop"

msgid "use the merge-base of upstream and branch as the current base"
msgstr ""
"gebruik die saamsmeltbasis van stroomop en die tak as die huidige basis"

msgid "allow pre-rebase hook to run"
msgstr "laat die pre-rebase-haak toe om te loop"

msgid "be quiet. implies --no-stat"
msgstr "wees stil. impliseer --no-stat"

msgid "display a diffstat of what changed upstream"
msgstr "vertoon 'n diffstat van wat stroomop verander het"

msgid "do not show diffstat of what changed upstream"
msgstr "moenie 'n diffstat van wat stroomop verander het wys nie"

msgid "add a Signed-off-by trailer to each commit"
msgstr "voeg 'n Signed-off-by-aanhangsel by elke vaslegging"

msgid "make committer date match author date"
msgstr "laat die vasleggerdatum met die outeurdatum ooreenstem"

msgid "ignore author date and use current date"
msgstr "ignoreer die outeurdatum en gebruik die huidige datum"

msgid "synonym of --reset-author-date"
msgstr "sinoniem van --reset-author-date"

msgid "passed to 'git apply'"
msgstr "deurgegee aan 'git apply'"

msgid "ignore changes in whitespace"
msgstr "ignoreer veranderinge in witspasie"

msgid "cherry-pick all commits, even if unchanged"
msgstr "kersiepluk alle vasleggings, selfs al is hulle onveranderd"

msgid "continue"
msgstr "gaan voort"

msgid "skip current patch and continue"
msgstr "slaan die huidige lap oor en gaan voort"

msgid "abort and check out the original branch"
msgstr "staak en check die oorspronklike tak uit"

msgid "abort but keep HEAD where it is"
msgstr "staak maar hou HEAD waar dit is"

msgid "edit the todo list during an interactive rebase"
msgstr "wysig die taaklys tydens 'n interaktiewe herbasering"

msgid "show the patch file being applied or merged"
msgstr "wys die laplêer wat toegepas of saamgesmelt word"

msgid "use apply strategies to rebase"
msgstr "gebruik apply-strategieë om te herbaseer"

msgid "use merging strategies to rebase"
msgstr "gebruik saamsmeltstrategieë om te herbaseer"

msgid "let the user edit the list of commits to rebase"
msgstr "laat die gebruiker die lys vasleggings wysig wat herbaseer moet word"

msgid "(REMOVED) was: try to recreate merges instead of ignoring them"
msgstr ""
"(VERWYDER) was: probeer saamsmeltings herskep in plaas daarvan om hulle te "
"ignoreer"

msgid "keep commits which start empty"
msgstr "behou vasleggings wat leeg begin"

msgid "move commits that begin with squash!/fixup! under -i"
msgstr "skuif vasleggings wat met squash!/fixup! begin onder -i"

msgid "update branches that point to commits that are being rebased"
msgstr "werk takke by wat na vasleggings wys wat tans herbaseer word"

msgid "add exec lines after each commit of the editable list"
msgstr "voeg exec-reëls by na elke vaslegging van die wysigbare lys"

msgid "allow rebasing commits with empty messages"
msgstr "laat die herbasering van vasleggings met leë boodskappe toe"

msgid "try to rebase merges instead of skipping them"
msgstr "probeer saamsmeltings herbaseer in plaas daarvan om hulle oor te slaan"

msgid "use 'merge-base --fork-point' to refine upstream"
msgstr "gebruik 'merge-base --fork-point' om stroomop te verfyn"

msgid "use the given merge strategy"
msgstr "gebruik die gegewe saamsmeltstrategie"

msgid "option"
msgstr "opsie"

msgid "pass the argument through to the merge strategy"
msgstr "gee die argument deur na die saamsmeltstrategie"

msgid "rebase all reachable commits up to the root(s)"
msgstr "herbaseer alle bereikbare vasleggings tot by die wortel(s)"

msgid "automatically re-schedule any `exec` that fails"
msgstr "herskeduleer outomaties enige `exec` wat misluk"

msgid "apply all changes, even those already present upstream"
msgstr "pas alle veranderinge toe, selfs dié wat reeds stroomop bestaan"

msgid "It looks like 'git am' is in progress. Cannot rebase."
msgstr "Dit lyk of 'git am' aan die gang is. Kan nie herbaseer nie."

msgid ""
"`rebase --preserve-merges` (-p) is no longer supported.\n"
"Use `git rebase --abort` to terminate current rebase.\n"
