msgid ""
"By default, updating the current branch in a non-bare repository\n"
"is denied, because it will make the index and work tree inconsistent\n"
"with what you pushed, and will require 'git reset --hard' to match\n"
"the work tree to HEAD.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the 'receive.denyCurrentBranch' configuration variable\n"
"to 'ignore' or 'warn' in the remote repository to allow pushing into\n"
"its current branch; however, this is not recommended unless you\n"
"arranged to update its work tree to match what you pushed in some\n"
"other way.\n"
"\n"
"To squelch this message and still keep the default behaviour, set\n"
"'receive.denyCurrentBranch' configuration variable to 'refuse'."
msgstr ""
"By verstek word die bywerk van die huidige tak in 'n nie-kaal bewaarplek\n"
"geweier, omdat dit die indeks en werkboom onsamehangend sal maak met\n"
"wat jy gestoot het, en 'git reset --hard' sal vereis om die werkboom\n"
"met HEAD te laat ooreenstem.\n"
"\n"
"Jy kan die 'receive.denyCurrentBranch'-konfigurasieveranderlike in die\n"
"afgeleë bewaarplek op 'ignore' of 'warn' stel om stoot na sy huidige\n"
"tak toe te laat; dit word egter nie aanbeveel nie, tensy jy op 'n ander\n"
"manier gereël het dat sy werkboom bygewerk word om met wat jy gestoot\n"
"het ooreen te stem.\n"
"\n"
"Om hierdie boodskap stil te maak en steeds die verstekgedrag te behou,\n"
"stel die 'receive.denyCurrentBranch'-konfigurasieveranderlike op 'refuse'."

msgid ""
"By default, deleting the current branch is denied, because the next\n"
"'git clone' won't result in any file checked out, causing confusion.\n"
"\n"
"You can set 'receive.denyDeleteCurrent' configuration variable to\n"
"'warn' or 'ignore' in the remote repository to allow deleting the\n"
"current branch, with or without a warning message.\n"
"\n"
"To squelch this message, you can set it to 'refuse'."
msgstr ""
"By verstek word die skrap van die huidige tak geweier, omdat die volgende\n"
"'git clone' nie tot enige uitgecheckte lêer sal lei nie, wat verwarring\n"
"veroorsaak.\n"
"\n"
"Jy kan die 'receive.denyDeleteCurrent'-konfigurasieveranderlike in die\n"
"afgeleë bewaarplek op 'warn' of 'ignore' stel om die skrap van die\n"
"huidige tak toe te laat, met of sonder 'n waarskuwingsboodskap.\n"
"\n"
"Om hierdie boodskap stil te maak, kan jy dit op 'refuse' stel."

