msgid ""
"Git normally never creates a ref that ends with 40 hex characters\n"
"because it will be ignored when you just specify 40-hex. These refs\n"
"may be created by mistake. For example,\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -c $br $(git rev-parse ...)\n"
"\n"
"where \"$br\" is somehow empty and a 40-hex ref is created. Please\n"
"examine these refs and maybe delete them. Turn this message off by\n"
"running \"git config set advice.objectNameWarning false\""
msgstr ""
"Git skep normaalweg nooit 'n verwysing wat op 40 heksadesimale karakters\n"
"eindig nie, omdat dit geïgnoreer sal word wanneer jy net 40-heks "
"spesifiseer.\n"
"Hierdie verwysings kan per ongeluk geskep word. Byvoorbeeld,\n"
"\n"
"  git switch -c $br $(git rev-parse ...)\n"
"\n"
"waar \"$br\" op een of ander manier leeg is en 'n 40-heks-verwysing geskep\n"
"word. Ondersoek asseblief hierdie verwysings en skrap hulle dalk. Skakel\n"
"hierdie boodskap af deur \"git config set advice.objectNameWarning false\"\n"
"uit te voer"

