msgid ""
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"p, pick <commit> = use commit\n"
"r, reword <commit> = use commit, but edit the commit message\n"
"e, edit <commit> = use commit, but stop for amending\n"
"s, squash <commit> = use commit, but meld into previous commit\n"
"f, fixup [-C | -c] <commit> = like \"squash\" but keep only the previous\n"
"                   commit's log message, unless -C is used, in which case\n"
"                   keep only this commit's message; -c is same as -C but\n"
"                   opens the editor\n"
"x, exec <command> = run command (the rest of the line) using shell\n"
"b, break = stop here (continue rebase later with 'git rebase --continue')\n"
"d, drop <commit> = remove commit\n"
"l, label <label> = label current HEAD with a name\n"
"t, reset <label> = reset HEAD to a label\n"
"m, merge [-C <commit> | -c <commit>] <label> [# <oneline>]\n"
"        create a merge commit using the original merge commit's\n"
"        message (or the oneline, if no original merge commit was\n"
"        specified); use -c <commit> to reword the commit message\n"
"u, update-ref <ref> = track a placeholder for the <ref> to be updated\n"
"                      to this position in the new commits. The <ref> is\n"
"                      updated at the end of the rebase\n"
"\n"
"These lines can be re-ordered; they are executed from top to bottom.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Opdragte:\n"
"p, pick <vaslegging> = gebruik vaslegging\n"
"r, reword <vaslegging> = gebruik vaslegging, maar wysig die "
"vasleggingsboodskap\n"
"e, edit <vaslegging> = gebruik vaslegging, maar stop om te wysig\n"
"s, squash <vaslegging> = gebruik vaslegging, maar smelt dit in die vorige "
"vaslegging in\n"
"f, fixup [-C | -c] <vaslegging> = soos \"squash\", maar behou slegs die "
"vorige\n"
"                   vaslegging se logboodskap, tensy -C gebruik word; in "
"daardie geval\n"
"                   word slegs hierdie vaslegging se boodskap behou; -c is "
"dieselfde as -C,\n"
"                   maar maak die redigeerder oop\n"
"x, exec <opdrag> = voer opdrag (die res van die reël) met die dop uit\n"
"b, break = stop hier (gaan later met die herbasering voort met 'git rebase --"
"continue')\n"
"d, drop <vaslegging> = verwyder vaslegging\n"
"l, label <merker> = merk huidige HEAD met 'n naam\n"
"t, reset <merker> = stel HEAD terug na 'n merker\n"
"m, merge [-C <vaslegging> | -c <vaslegging>] <merker> [# <eenreël>]\n"
"        skep 'n saamsmeltvaslegging met die oorspronklike "
"saamsmeltvaslegging se\n"
"        boodskap (of die eenreël, as geen oorspronklike saamsmeltvaslegging\n"
"        gespesifiseer is nie); gebruik -c <vaslegging> om die "
"vasleggingsboodskap te herformuleer\n"
"u, update-ref <verwysing> = hou 'n plekhouer by vir die <verwysing> wat na "
"hierdie\n"
"                      posisie in die nuwe vasleggings bygewerk moet word. "
"Die <verwysing>\n"
"                      word aan die einde van die herbasering bygewerk\n"
"\n"
"Hierdie reëls kan herrangskik word; hulle word van bo na onder uitgevoer.\n"

#, c-format
msgid "Rebase %s onto %s (%d command)"
