msgid ""
"\n"
"Do not remove any line. Use 'drop' explicitly to remove a commit.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Moenie enige reël verwyder nie. Gebruik 'drop' uitdruklik om 'n vaslegging "
"te verwyder.\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"If you remove a line here THAT COMMIT WILL BE LOST.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"As jy 'n reël hier verwyder, SAL DAARDIE VASLEGGING VERLORE GAAN.\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You are editing the todo file of an ongoing interactive rebase.\n"
"To continue rebase after editing, run:\n"
"    git rebase --continue\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Jy wysig die todo-lêer van 'n lopende interaktiewe herbasering.\n"
"Om ná die wysiging met die herbasering voort te gaan, voer uit:\n"
"    git rebase --continue\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"However, if you remove everything, the rebase will be aborted.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"As jy egter alles verwyder, sal die herbasering gestaak word.\n"
"\n"

