"Stel sendemail.forbidSendmailVariables op false om hierdie kontrole te "
"deaktiveer.\n"

msgid "Cannot run git format-patch from outside a repository\n"
msgstr "Kan nie git format-patch van buite 'n bewaarplek uitvoer nie\n"

msgid ""
"`batch-size` and `relogin` must be specified together (via command-line or "
"configuration option)\n"
msgstr ""
"`batch-size` en `relogin` moet saam gespesifiseer word (via die opdragreël "
"of 'n konfigurasie-opsie)\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Unknown --suppress-cc field: '%s'\n"
msgstr "Onbekende veld --suppress-cc: '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Unknown --confirm setting: '%s'\n"
msgstr "Onbekende instelling --confirm: '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "warning: sendmail alias with quotes is not supported: %s\n"
msgstr ""
"waarskuwing: sendmail-alias met aanhalingstekens word nie ondersteun nie: "
"%s\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "warning: `:include:` not supported: %s\n"
msgstr "waarskuwing: `:include:` word nie ondersteun nie: %s\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "warning: `/file` or `|pipe` redirection not supported: %s\n"
msgstr ""
"waarskuwing: `/file`- of `|pipe`-herleiding word nie ondersteun nie: %s\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "warning: sendmail line is not recognized: %s\n"
msgstr "waarskuwing: sendmail-reël word nie herken nie: %s\n"

#, perl-format
msgid ""
"File '%s' exists but it could also be the range of commits\n"
"to produce patches for.  Please disambiguate by...\n"
"\n"
"    * Saying \"./%s\" if you mean a file; or\n"
"    * Giving --format-patch option if you mean a range.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lêer '%s' bestaan, maar dit kan ook die reeks vasleggings wees\n"
"waarvoor lappe gemaak moet word.  Maak dit asseblief ondubbelsinnig deur...\n"
"\n"
"    * \"./%s\" te sê as jy 'n lêer bedoel; of\n"
"    * die opsie --format-patch te gee as jy 'n reeks bedoel.\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Failed to opendir %s: %s"
msgstr "Kon nie opendir op %s uitvoer nie: %s"

msgid ""
"\n"
"No patch files specified!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Geen laplêers gespesifiseer nie!\n"
"\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "No 'Subject:' line in '%s'\n"
msgstr "Geen reël 'Subject:' in '%s' nie\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Failed to open for writing %s: %s"
msgstr "Kon nie %s vir skryf oopmaak nie: %s"

msgid ""
"Lines beginning in \"GIT:\" will be removed.\n"
"Consider including an overall diffstat or table of contents\n"
"for the patch you are writing.\n"
"\n"
"Clear the body content if you don't wish to send a summary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Reëls wat met \"GIT:\" begin, sal verwyder word.\n"
"Oorweeg dit om 'n algehele diffstat of inhoudsopgawe in te sluit\n"
"vir die lap wat jy skryf.\n"
"\n"
"Maak die inhoud van die liggaam skoon as jy nie 'n opsomming wil stuur nie.\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Failed to open %s.final: %s"
msgstr "Kon nie %s.final oopmaak nie: %s"

#, perl-format
msgid "Failed to open %s: %s"
msgstr "Kon nie %s oopmaak nie: %s"

msgid "Summary email is empty, skipping it\n"
msgstr "Opsomming-e-pos is leeg, dit word oorgeslaan\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: please keep [y/N] as is.
#, perl-format
msgid "Are you sure you want to use <%s> [y/N]? "
msgstr "Is jy seker jy wil <%s> gebruik [y/N]? "

msgid ""
"The following files are 8bit, but do not declare a Content-Transfer-"
"Encoding.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die volgende lêers is 8-bis, maar verklaar nie 'n Content-Transfer-Encoding "
"nie.\n"

msgid "Declare which 8bit encoding to use [default: UTF-8]? "
msgstr "Watter 8-bis-enkodering moet gebruik word [verstek: UTF-8]? "

#, perl-format
msgid "'%s' does not appear to be a valid charset name. Use it anyway [y/N]? "
msgstr ""
"'%s' lyk nie na 'n geldige karakterstelnaam nie. Gebruik dit in elk geval [y/"
"N]? "

#, perl-format
msgid ""
"Refusing to send because the patch\n"
"\t%s\n"
"has the template subject '*** SUBJECT HERE ***'. Pass --force if you really "
"want to send.\n"
msgstr ""
"Weier om te stuur omdat die lap\n"
"\t%s\n"
"die sjabloononderwerp '*** SUBJECT HERE ***' het. Gee --force as jy regtig "
"wil stuur.\n"

msgid "To whom should the emails be sent (if anyone)?"
msgstr "Aan wie moet die e-posse gestuur word (indien enigiemand)?"

#, perl-format
msgid "fatal: alias '%s' expands to itself\n"
msgstr "fataal: alias '%s' brei na homself uit\n"

msgid "Message-ID to be used as In-Reply-To for the first email (if any)? "
msgstr ""
"Message-ID om as In-Reply-To vir die eerste e-pos te gebruik (indien enige)? "

#, perl-format
msgid "error: unable to extract a valid address from: %s\n"
msgstr "fout: kan nie 'n geldige adres onttrek uit: %s\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: Make sure to include [q] [d] [e] in your
#. translation. The program will only accept English input
#. at this point.
msgid "What to do with this address? ([q]uit|[d]rop|[e]dit): "
msgstr ""
"Wat om met hierdie adres te doen? ([q] verlaat|[d] laat val|[e] wysig): "

#, perl-format
msgid "CA path \"%s\" does not exist"
msgstr "CA-pad \"%s\" bestaan nie"

#, perl-format
msgid "Only client key \"%s\" specified"
msgstr "Slegs kliëntsleutel \"%s\" gespesifiseer"

msgid ""
"    The Cc list above has been expanded by additional\n"
"    addresses found in the patch commit message. By default\n"
"    send-email prompts before sending whenever this occurs.\n"
"    This behavior is controlled by the sendemail.confirm\n"
"    configuration setting.\n"
"\n"
"    For additional information, run 'git send-email --help'.\n"
"    To retain the current behavior, but squelch this message,\n"
"    run 'git config --global sendemail.confirm auto'.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"    Die Cc-lys hierbo is uitgebrei met bykomende adresse\n"
"    wat in die lap se vasleggingsboodskap gevind is. By verstek\n"
"    vra send-email voor stuur wanneer dit gebeur.\n"
"    Hierdie gedrag word deur die sendemail.confirm-\n"
"    konfigurasie-instelling beheer.\n"
"\n"
"    Voer 'git send-email --help' uit vir meer inligting.\n"
"    Om die huidige gedrag te behou, maar hierdie boodskap te\n"
"    onderdruk, voer 'git config --global sendemail.confirm auto' uit.\n"
"\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: Make sure to include [y] [n] [e] [q] [a] in your
#. translation. The program will only accept English input
#. at this point.
msgid "Send this email? ([y]es|[n]o|[e]dit|[q]uit|[a]ll): "
msgstr ""
"Stuur hierdie e-pos? ([y] ja|[n] nee|[e] wysig|[q] verlaat|[a] almal): "

msgid "Send this email reply required"
msgstr "Stuur hierdie e-pos? Antwoord word vereis"

msgid "The destination IMAP folder is not properly defined."
msgstr "Die bestemming-IMAP-vouer is nie behoorlik gedefinieer nie."

msgid "The required SMTP server is not properly defined."
msgstr "Die vereiste SMTP-bediener is nie behoorlik gedefinieer nie."

#, perl-format
msgid "Server does not support STARTTLS! %s"
msgstr "Bediener ondersteun nie STARTTLS nie! %s"

#, perl-format
msgid "STARTTLS failed! %s"
msgstr "STARTTLS het misluk! %s"

msgid "Unable to initialize SMTP properly. Check config and use --smtp-debug."
msgstr ""
"Kan nie SMTP behoorlik inisialiseer nie. Kontroleer die konfigurasie en "
"gebruik --smtp-debug."

#, perl-format
msgid "Outlook reassigned Message-ID to: %s\n"
msgstr "Outlook het Message-ID hertoegeken aan: %s\n"

msgid "Warning: Could not retrieve Message-ID from server response.\n"
msgstr ""
"Waarskuwing: Kon nie Message-ID uit die bediener se antwoord kry nie.\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Failed to send %s\n"
msgstr "Kon nie %s stuur nie\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Dry-Sent %s"
msgstr "Droog gestuur %s"

#, perl-format
msgid "Sent %s"
msgstr "%s gestuur"

msgid "Dry-OK. Log says:"
msgstr "Droog-OK. Log sê:"

msgid "OK. Log says:"
msgstr "OK. Log sê:"

msgid "Result: "
msgstr "Resultaat: "

msgid "Result: OK"
msgstr "Resultaat: OK"

#, perl-format
msgid "can't open file %s"
msgstr "kan nie lêer %s oopmaak nie"

#, perl-format
msgid "(mbox) Adding cc: %s from line '%s'\n"
msgstr "(mbox) Voeg cc by: %s uit reël '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "(mbox) Adding to: %s from line '%s'\n"
msgstr "(mbox) Voeg to by: %s uit reël '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "(non-mbox) Adding cc: %s from line '%s'\n"
msgstr "(nie-mbox) Voeg cc by: %s uit reël '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "(body) Adding cc: %s from line '%s'\n"
msgstr "(liggaam) Voeg cc by: %s uit reël '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "error: invalid SMTP port '%s'\n"
msgstr "fout: ongeldige SMTP-poort '%s'\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "(%s) Could not execute '%s'"
msgstr "(%s) Kon nie '%s' uitvoer nie"

#, perl-format
msgid "(%s) Malformed output from '%s'"
msgstr "(%s) Misvormde afvoer van '%s'"

#, perl-format
msgid "(%s) failed to close pipe to '%s'"
msgstr "(%s) kon nie pyp na '%s' toemaak nie"

#, perl-format
msgid "(%s) Adding %s: %s from: '%s'\n"
msgstr "(%s) Voeg %s by: %s van: '%s'\n"

msgid "cannot send message as 7bit"
msgstr "kan nie boodskap as 7-bis stuur nie"

msgid "invalid transfer encoding"
msgstr "ongeldige oordragenkodering"

#, perl-format
msgid ""
"fatal: %s: rejected by %s hook\n"
"%s\n"
"warning: no patches were sent\n"
msgstr ""
"fataal: %s: deur %s-haak verwerp\n"
"%s\n"
"waarskuwing: geen lappe is gestuur nie\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "unable to open %s: %s\n"
msgstr "kan nie %s oopmaak nie: %s\n"

#, perl-format
msgid ""
"fatal: %s:%d is longer than 998 characters\n"
"warning: no patches were sent\n"
msgstr ""
"fataal: %s:%d is langer as 998 karakters\n"
"waarskuwing: geen lappe is gestuur nie\n"

#, perl-format
msgid "Skipping %s with backup suffix '%s'.\n"
msgstr "Slaan %s met rugsteunagtervoegsel '%s' oor.\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: please keep "[y|N]" as is.
#, perl-format
msgid "Do you really want to send %s? [y|N]: "
msgstr "Wil jy %s regtig stuur? [y|N]: "
